{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "1", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἀγλαΐας τόδε σοι Βυζάντιος ἐσθλὸν ἰάλλω"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "2", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἰητὴρ ἑτάρῳ δῶρον ἀοιδοπόλῳ,"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "3", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ὁφθαλμῶν μὲν ἄκος, Δημήτερα (?) τῶν ὑποχεῖσθαι"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "4", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἀρχομένων, ὑπʼ ἐμῆς δʼ εὑρεθὲν εὐμογίης."}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "5", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Καί σοι δʼ ἔξοχον ἔσται ἐς ἄχθεα, παντί τʼ ὄνειαρ"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "6", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Παρμόνιμον, κάμψῃς ἄχρι κεν ἐς πλέονας."}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "7", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ὅσσα δʼ ἔχει θρόνα λέξαι ἔοικε μοι, ὡς ἐπαρήγειν"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "8", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Οἷς ἄν τι σθεναρὴ σύνθεσις ἥδε πέλει."}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "9", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἄνθους μὲν χαλκοῦ πεντώβολον, ἰσοβαρὲς δὲ"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "10", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Τοῦ συοδηλήτου τὴν ἀρετὴν γενέτιν·"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "11", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Καὶ μεῖον τούτων ὀβολῷ στρόγγυλμα πυραιθὲς"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "12", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Πρόσθες, ὃ Γαλλαϊκοῖς (?) ἀλδαίνετ’ ἐν δαπέδοις·"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "13", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Καὶ δύο διδράχμω, τὸ μὲν ἐκ ξανθότριχος ἄνθους,"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "14", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἔνυμα * δʼ ἐκ μηδέων θάτερον ἱπποδάμου·"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "15", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἡμίσταθμον, ὃ τοῦ πατρὸς ψευδώνυμος, ἔστω"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "16", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ὃς γῆμαι δμωῆς υἱέϊ δῶκε κόρην·"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "17", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Στῆσον δʼ αὖ ἀλόϊον ἒν ἥμισυ τοῦ προτέροιο"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "18", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἄχθος· ἄγε στάχυος Σινδογενοῦς ὀβολόν·"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "19", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Διστάσιος δʼ αὐτῷ πελέτω λίθος εἰαριήτης·"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "20", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Διστάσιον δʼ ἀφροῦ θρύμμα φακουσιακοῦ·"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "21", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Σὺν δὲ τριάκοντα δραχμαῖς ἔτι καὶ δύο μίσγε"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "22", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ὁλκὰς ἐξ ἄνθους ναμασιπηγὸς ἁλός·"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "23", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Καὶ Ζακορίσου * Μούσαις ἰσάριθμον ὄπισμα"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "24", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Δραχμόθεν ἔστω σοι συγκατακιρνάμενον"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "25", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Τετραμόρῳ κοτύλης, ὃ τιτύσκεται οὐ διὰ χειρῶν"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "26", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Ἐν δαπεδοῖς * Bάκτης, ἀλλὰ διὰ στομάτων."}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "27", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Λεῖα δὲ πάντα καθʼ ἓν τρίψας ἀνάμισγε σὺν ὑγροῖς,"}
{"urn": "aglais.adversus-suffusiones-incipientes", "edition": "1st1K-grc1", "locus": "28", "source": "first1k", "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "text": "Τημελέως τʼ ἀπόθου τεῦχος ἐς ἀργύρεον."}
